er people anymore however he  pities rin and agrees to escort her back  home  along the way they encounter an ido ryu  member kuroy sabato who tortured and  took rin's mother he gives rin some of  her mother's hair and even shows her  decapitated head that he mounts on his  shoulder  rin is shocked as sabato prepares to  take her too manji shows up and defeats  him  sabato successfully strikes a fatal blow  at manji but due to his abilities mongi  can heal himself leaving rin in awe  mongi agrees to train rin and protects  her until she can avenge her parents  kagahisa talks with hibaki a government  representative about an agreement to put  ido ryu in the shogunate and make him  the head of the new martial arts academy  he then receives news of sabato's death  and is confused as he knows rin is not  that skilled to take down one of his  best assassins  meanwhile rin is sharpening mongi's  knives and daggers in the town market  when she notices a man using her  father's sword that man is tito magitsu  sent by kagaheeza to deal with kuroi's  murderers  mongi learns of him from wren and  quickly heads to challenge magitsu manji  wins the fight leaving magetsu badly  injured  after mistaking rin for maki rin finally  learns that she reminds mongi of his  deceased sister although he refuses to  talk further about it  the injured maguetsu receives treatment  at the ito ryu base and reports to  kagahisa that an immortal swordsman is  hired as rin's bodyguard  rin and manji travel to a village and  they stop by for a meal  manji is reading a map about every dojo  conquered by the ido ryu when another  ido ryu swordsman iku shitsuma posing as  a monk approaches him  he expresses that he would like mongi to  join him so they can defeat kagahisa  together  mongi denies the offer as his gut  feeling tells him that something is not  right  enraged shitsuma draws his sword then  they fight ruthlessly  turns out shitsuma is also immortal for  a longer period than mongi  he poisons his sword to weaken the  bloodworms and slows down mongi's  self-healing abilities  however mongi is determined to protect  rin despite his own wishes to end his  immortality so he defeats shitsuma later  at the town market mongi and ren  encounter makey another ido remember  although gaining the upper hand makey  could not bring herself to murder mongi  even though she has severed his limbs  she questions whether ido ryu's motives  are the right thing to do then she  observes rin standing up for mongi  although she is not as skilled as him  maki decides not to end their lives and  leaves  although slowly mongi can still recover  he scolds rin for defending himself  because she is not supposed to do that  he tells her to train alone as he has  something to do that day which is  visiting maki's grave  rin wanders alone then encounters  kagaheeza  she is surprised to find that he does  not attack her  he explains that he murdered her father  to avenge his grandfather kagaheez's  grandfather was banished from the dojo  led by rin's great-grandfather because  he used an axe which was considered an  outsider weapon and not fit for their  fighting style  arriving back at mongi's crib rin does  not tell him that he encountered  kagahisa and knew the truth about their  ancestors the next day rin and mongi  encounter mugai ryu another swordsman  clan after seeing one of its members  shira defeating another ido ryu member  shira brings them to mughai ryu's  hideout where they meet other members  they explain that they need to stay  hidden so that the ido will not realize  that they have two enemies then offer  manji and rin to join them to defeat ido  ryu together based on their spy  disguising himself as an ido ryu member  kagahisa will visit mount takao  they form a plan to attack him along his  way by dividing themselves into two  groups that will take different routes  manji rin and shira are grouped together  along the way they notice a mysterious  figure resembling kagahesa so they  prepare to attack him  shira strikes a blow to his face which  turns out to be a woman hired by the ido  ryu at the same time other ido ryu  members appear from behind the trees and  they realize that they have been trapped  manji and shira fight the ido ryu  members until they are all defeated  after that shira attempts to harass the  hired woman  rin stands up for her but shira easily  injures her  luckily before shira tries to do  anything with rin manji cuts off one of  his hands causing him to escape  manji realizes he cannot work with the  mughai ryu especially shira due to their  different principles back home mongi  treats rin's wounds and tells her his  full story he was ordered by a superior  to murder several men which turned out  to be the man who would have reported  his superior's crimes believing that he  worked for the wrong cause mongi  betrayed his superior and murdered him  and his bodyguards instead  turns out one of his bodyguards was  maki's husband his death greatly  affected her sending her into madness  then mongi took her under his care he  warns rin that if she stands up to  defend him again he will quit working  for her believing that she only caused  manji trouble rin runs away the next day  continuing her quest for revenge on her  own while manji is outside he is  approached by other members of the  mughai ryu who ask him where shira is  he explains he cannot continue working  with him anymore  they explain that they must defeat ido  ryu because they are facing death  sentences from the government after  realizing rin is gone manji frantically  goes after her  meanwhile kagahesa reaches mount takao  and meets with ibane kenchuy the head of  shinkaito ryu although he is warmly  welcomed he soon learns that they will  not join ido ryu disappointed he leaves  while his comrades back home celebrate a  supposedly successful deal turns out  habbaki has betrayed the ido ryu by  sending government swordsmen to capture  kagahisa 