hesitates causing  kagaheeza to counter-attack her instead  luckily mongi positions himself in her  way taking the hit rin quickly stabs  kagaheeza right through the chest  after kagaheez's last breath rin cries  for mongi whom she thinks is dying  she cries that he does not fulfill his  promise to die after her  turns out manji is still alive despite  his bad wounds and replies to her that  she should call him big brother just  like maki did  subscribe to watch more videos like this  turn on notifications and leave a like  to help the channel out thank you for  watching

